name: ['Ajani, Mentor of Heroes', 'Dack Fayden', 'Daretti, Ingenious Iconoclast', 'Domri, Chaos Bringer', 'Elspeth, Knight-Errant', 'Garruk, Apex Predator', 'Gideon Blackblade', 'Jace, the Mind Sculptor', 'Jaya Ballard', 'Karn, Scion of Urza', 'Kaya, Orzhov Usurper', 'Liliana, the Last Hope', 'Nahiri, the Harbinger', 'Nicol Bolas, Dragon-God', 'Nicol Bolas, Planeswalker', 'Ral, Izzet Viceroy', 'Sarkhan Unbroken', 'Sorin Markov', 'Tamiyo, the Moon Sage', 'Teferi, Hero of Dominaria', 'Tezzeret the Seeker', 'Tezzeret, Agent of Bolas', 'Ugin, the Spirit Dragon', 'Vraska, Golgari Queen']
